        "duration_short": "- Present",
        "info": "During the Covid19 pandemic I realised that the elderly living alone would have a problem arranging items of daily need while staying inside for safety against the virus. I started a volunteer based organisation Errands for Elders in Panchkula to run errands for the elderly at no extra cost to them. I later expanded it to the Chandigarh Tricity, Delhi NCR Region, Meerut, and Goa. My immediate goal for EFE is to get more volunteers involved in these cities so that we can help more elderly people\u2026 Show more During the Covid19 pandemic I realised that the elderly living alone would have a problem arranging items of daily need while staying inside for safety against the virus. I started a volunteer based organisation Errands for Elders in Panchkula to run errands for the elderly at no extra cost to them. I later expanded it to the Chandigarh Tricity, Delhi NCR Region, Meerut, and Goa. My immediate goal for EFE is to get more volunteers involved in these cities so that we can help more elderly people efficiently. Over the next year, I plan to expand Errands for Elders to include more semi-urban and urban cities. Errands for Elders has been able to assist over 1000 elderly living alone. I ran over 750 errands for Errands for Elders in 2020 in the Chandigarh Tricity and was responsible for the training of new volunteers and training and selecting the city head in Delhi NCR Region, Meerut, and Goa. Show less",
